1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,258
Now the twist.

2
00:00:01,278 --> 00:00:01,875
The second is over,

3
00:00:01,875 --> 00:00:02,647
and Earth starts spinning

4
00:00:02,647 --> 00:00:04,137
again, instantly.

5
00:00:04,157 --> 00:00:05,502
Anything still flying east is

6
00:00:05,502 --> 00:00:06,647
suddenly back in sync with

7
00:00:06,647 --> 00:00:07,366
the ground.

8
00:00:07,386 --> 00:00:08,035
Lucky.

9
00:00:08,055 --> 00:00:09,037
But everything that crashed

10
00:00:09,037 --> 00:00:09,934
and stopped during that

11
00:00:09,934 --> 00:00:10,555
second?

12
00:00:10,575 --> 00:00:11,844
The ground races back under

13
00:00:11,844 --> 00:00:12,825
it at full speed.

14
00:00:12,845 --> 00:00:14,113
So the whole disaster happens

15
00:00:14,113 --> 00:00:14,757
again...

16
00:00:14,777 --> 00:00:15,715
in the other direction.

17
00:00:16,415 --> 00:00:17,768
Physics would like a word.

18
00:00:17,788 --> 00:00:18,947
Earth's spin stores about

19
00:00:18,947 --> 00:00:21,585
2×10²⁹ joules of energy.

20
00:00:21,605 --> 00:00:22,909
Stopping it means dumping all

21
00:00:22,909 --> 00:00:23,805
of that somewhere.

22
00:00:23,825 --> 00:00:24,837
That's roughly what the Sun

23
00:00:24,837 --> 00:00:26,310
pours out in nine minutes.

24
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:26,999
All of the Sun.

25
00:00:27,699 --> 00:00:28,898
And if Earth never started

26
00:00:28,898 --> 00:00:29,490
again?

27
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:30,485
One day would last a

28
00:00:30,485 --> 00:00:31,192
whole year.

29
00:00:31,212 --> 00:00:32,662
Six months of daylight,

30
00:00:32,682 --> 00:00:33,986
then six months of night.

31
00:00:34,006 --> 00:00:34,879
And the Sun would rise

32
00:00:34,879 --> 00:00:35,633
in the west.

33
00:00:35,653 --> 00:00:36,263
Over time,

34
00:00:36,283 --> 00:00:37,276
the oceans would migrate

35
00:00:37,276 --> 00:00:38,233
toward the poles,

36
00:00:38,253 --> 00:00:39,489
leaving one giant continent

37
00:00:39,489 --> 00:00:40,437
wrapped around the equator.

38
00:00:41,137 --> 00:00:42,327
Here's the wild part:
